    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"Stop being the one who hears them...\" That's a heavy thing to say. It sounds like you're saying the only way to find peace is to just... finish it. To make the debt settled once and for all. Is that what honor looks like now? Just finding a way to disappear?",
